<title>USA: GTI Corp CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>GTI Corp CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTI Corp said vice president and chief financial officer Douglas Downs has tendered his resignation effective immediately, to pursue other career opportunities.</p>
<p>The company said Downs' duties will be assumed on an interim basis by Scott Meader, controller of GTI's Volor Electronics Inc subsidiary.</p>
